-- src:15361 | (ga) any application or other document delivered to the registrar under section 1097A , 1097B or 1097C (rectification of registered office, service address or principal office address) other than an order or direction of the court;
-- src:15362 | (gb) any application or other document delivered to the registrar under section 1098B, 1098D or 1098E or regulations under section 1098G (authorised corporate service providers);
-- src:15363 | (gc) any document delivered to the registrar under regulations under section 1110B;
