    WHEN `s 1088(7)(d) section 1110F (general powers of disclosure by the registrar)` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Regulations under subsection (1)(d) may not require the registrar to refrain from disclosing information under section 1110F"
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar names section 1110F only

