§§ `ss 1092A and 1092B Further information`

-- src:15469 | (1) The registrar may by notice in writing require a person to provide information to the registrar for the purposes of enabling the registrar to determine—
-- src:15470 | (a) whether a person has complied with any obligation imposed by an enactment to deliver a document to the registrar,
-- src:15471 | (b) whether any information contained in a document received by the registrar falls within section 1080(1)(a).
@ref s 1092A(1) The registrar may require information by notice in writing (src:15469-15471)
GIVEN `the requirement is made by notice in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is for the purposes of determining whether a person has complied with an obligation imposed by an enactment to deliver a document to the registrar` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is for the purposes of determining whether information contained in a document received by the registrar falls within section 1080(1)(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 1092A(1) the registrar may require the person to provide the information` MEANS
    IF `the requirement is made by notice in writing` AND (`it is for the purposes of determining whether a person has complied with an obligation imposed by an enactment to deliver a document to the registrar` OR `it is for the purposes of determining whether information contained in a document received by the registrar falls within section 1080(1)(a)`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "by notice in writing require a person to provide information to the registrar for the purposes of enabling the registrar to determine— (a) ... (b) ..."

DECLARE `s 1092A(2) matter a requirement may specify` IS ONE OF
    `s 1092A(2)(a) the form and manner in which the information is to be provided`
    `s 1092A(2)(b) the period within which the information is to be provided`
    `s 1092A(2) another matter`

